     text-decoration-thickness: 2px;\n        }\n        .section-title {\n            font-weight: bold;\n            font-size: 18px;\n            margin: 30px 0 20px 0;\n        }\n        .list-item {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: flex-start;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            text-align: justify;\n        }\n        .list-prefix {\n            margin-right: 5px;\n            white-space: nowrap;\n        }\n        .example-text {\n            margin-top: 30px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"title-container\">\n            <div class=\"deco deco-1\"></div>\n            <div class=\"deco deco-2\"></div>\n            <div class=\"title\">① 角色选择</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <p>✨经常有人会问“我一米六脸比较圆适合出什么”，首先还是根据自己“喜欢”什么角色来定，<span class=\"highlight\">“喜爱”</span>永远是我们出cos的前提♡</p>\n\n        <p>✨（我一米七也出过小鸟游六花，真的呆胶布！）</p>\n\n        <div class=\"section-title\">💖正经萌新推荐💖</div>\n\n        <div class=\"list-item\">\n            <div class=\"list-prefix\">- ✨</div>\n            <div><span class=\"highlight\">尽量先出同性别的</span>，不要反串，因为反串角色在姿态，妆容动作上都会有很大的不同，新手最好还是从同性别的开始出。</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"list-item\">\n            <div class=\"list-prefix\">- ✨</div>\n            <div>由于漫展容易掉装备且游场很累，尽量出<span class=\"highlight\">无盔甲无大武器</span>（比如我的虚空剑...）的角色</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"list-item\">\n            <div class=\"list-prefix\">- ✨</div>\n            <div><span class=\"highlight\">无拖尾</span>，<span class=\"highlight\">无长发角色</span>。走在路上很容易被踩到，头发太长很容易<span class=\"wavy\">炸毛</span>，新手又不太会打理。（没错我在说我自己的拖尾，还有初音的绝对炸毛双马尾）</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"list-item\">\n            <div class=\"list-prefix\">- ✨</div>\n            <div>萌新推荐：<span class=\"highlight\">水手服日常角色</span>；相对于<span class=\"highlight\">热门的</span>角色；<span class=\"highlight\">穿起来不复杂</span>，且<span class=\"highlight\">发型长度不过腰</span>的角色。</div>\n        </div>\n\n        